OL,3,AUkraine anger as EU removes Russian
OL,4,Aoligarchs from sanctions list
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe European Union is to remove
OL,7,Fsanctions on two oligarchs imposed
OL,8,Fafter Russia's full-scale invasion of
OL,9,FUkraine in 2022, according to reports,
OL,10,Fprompting anger in Ukraine.
OL,12,FFrance had campaigned for Russian-Uzbek
OL,13,Fbillionaire Alisher Usmanov to be taken
OL,14,Foff the list, citing "national security
OL,15,Fconcerns". Luxembourg called for the
OL,16,Fremoval of Russian-Israeli businessman
OL,17,FMikhail Fridman, who is suing the
OL,18,Fcountry for the release of frozen
OL,19,Fassets.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
