OL,3,AUkraine anger as EU removes Russian
OL,4,Aoligarchs from sanctions list
OL,5,
OL,6,FLatvia initially opposed the deal but
OL,7,Fagreed to a compromise, part of which
OL,8,Finvolved extending sanctions on nearly
OL,9,F3,000 other individuals and entities
OL,10,Ffor three years.
OL,12,FUkrainian officials said the move was
OL,13,F"unacceptable" and sent the wrong
OL,14,Fsignal to Moscow.
